{"name": "Loot Frog", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot Frog</strong> is an\u00a0<strong>incremental action bullet hell</strong> where you\u00a0smash pots for loot, fight an evil cult, and grow stronger with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no resets and no idle mechanics. Every upgrade is permanent, and every run pushes you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Start small. Build momentum. Become unstoppable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tightly designed <strong>4 hour experience</strong> that keeps you coming back for <strong>\"just one more run\"</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/4673b1dd03a3ff100c28727dc034da0d.avif?t=1788007799\" width=\"750\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/3f9c37f420e329eb33490ffdd880750a.poster.avif?t=1788007799\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/3f9c37f420e329eb33490ffdd880750a.webm?t=1788007799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/3f9c37f420e329eb33490ffdd880750a.mp4?t=1788007799\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Break pots, defeat enemies, and collect resources</strong> to fuel your progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional incremental games, <strong>Loot Frog is fully active</strong>. You'll be constantly moving, dodging, and making real-time decisions in chaotic bullet hell combat, not just watching numbers go up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The better you play, the faster you grow. <strong>Every run makes you stronger</strong>, pushing you deeper into the dungeon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/5864c62430a69efb75519509063bc960.avif?t=1788007799\" width=\"750\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/4d5fc7ad9713fb0c0776ceba02d088f7.poster.avif?t=1788007799\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/4d5fc7ad9713fb0c0776ceba02d088f7.webm?t=1788007799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/4d5fc7ad9713fb0c0776ceba02d088f7.mp4?t=1788007799\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level introduces new <strong>enemy types with distinct behaviours</strong>, keeping combat fresh and challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face aggressive elites that test your skills, and take on <strong>unique bosses with different bullet patterns and mechanics</strong> at the end of each biome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through <strong>25 handcrafted levels across 5 biomes</strong>, each with its own challenges, hazards, and enemies to master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/0e64438d19920c0953ffa85fae9fd283.avif?t=1788007799\" width=\"750\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/afab7682e227384e9a0c23e873384c46.poster.avif?t=1788007799\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/afab7682e227384e9a0c23e873384c46.webm?t=1788007799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/extras/afab7682e227384e9a0c23e873384c46.mp4?t=1788007799\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a large branching skill tree with <strong>200+ meaningful upgrades and abilities</strong> that drastically change how you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on survivability, explosive power, or resource efficiency and <strong>create a build that fits your style</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no single correct path. <strong>You play at your own pace</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord server to stay tuned, share feedback, and chat with the community. The link is in the sidebar!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Loot Frog is an incremental action bullet hell about breaking pots, collecting gems, and fighting an evil cult. Upgrade your gear, unlock new abilities, explore diverse biomes, and push deeper into increasingly chaotic battles.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294860/21c7592c79d61ce0bbf31